WEBVTT

download-install
00:00:05.379 --> 00:00:08.535
Download the tarball
and run the installer.

doctor
00:00:08.615 --> 00:00:11.840
plaintake doctor checks
FFmpeg and Chromium.

scenario-file
00:00:13.178 --> 00:00:17.157
Define steps, captions and
chapters with defineDemo.

assert-outcome
00:00:17.237 --> 00:00:21.799
Declare an assert — a wrong
end state fails the run.

step-anatomy
00:00:21.879 --> 00:00:25.654
A step names its target
and action: click or type.

validate
00:00:26.977 --> 00:00:30.537
One command checks the
scenario before filming.

run-command
00:00:31.942 --> 00:00:35.250
Point plaintake run at
the scenario and your app.

rendered
00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:38.830
Chromium records; FFmpeg renders the film.

watch-output
00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:45.372
This is the exact file the run wrote.

bundle-tree
00:00:46.748 --> 00:00:50.978
Captions, a manifest and a
trace ship beside the MP4.

verify
00:00:51.058 --> 00:00:55.133
Verify re-checks every
artifact against the manifest.

whole-loop
00:00:55.213 --> 00:00:59.038
Install, write, validate,
run — then ship the video.
